aside [drawer-aside] label="Workings"
  div [drawer:trends] label="Workings: note_created, 5 Oct – 1 Nov · Trends insight · live"
    "Workings"
    "note_created, 5 Oct – 1 Nov · Trends insight · live"
    div [drawer-changed] role=status
    button [workings-close] label="Close workings (W)"
      "Close"
    div [drawer-scroll]
      div [station:emit]
        div [station-dot]
        div [station-head]
          "Emit"
          "the event catalogue"
        button [station-toggle] label="Emit station"
          "▾"
        div [station-body]
          "note_created"
          "is a Rust type in your app, so its properties are its fields and a misspelled one fails when it compiles. This is the shape the app last registered; the service doesn't record where in your code it's sent from."
          div [code]
            div [code-head]
              "Rust"
              button [copy] label="Copy as Rust"
                "Copy"
            div [code-line]
              "1"
              span [code-text]
                "#[derive(Event)]"
            div [code-line]
              "2"
              span [code-text]
                "struct"
                "NoteCreated"
                "{"
            div [code-line]
              "3"
              span [code-text]
                "words"
                ":"
                "u32"
                ","
            div [code-line]
              "4"
              span [code-text]
                "shared"
                ":"
                "bool"
                ","
            div [code-line]
              "5"
              span [code-text]
                "}"
      div [station:send]
        div [station-dot]
        div [station-head]
          "Send"
          "the latest note_created, re-encoded here"
        button [station-toggle] label="Send station"
          "▾"
        div [station-body]
          "Typed events send no property names, so this one is 85 bytes instead of 208: 59.1% smaller. Measured as one event alone in a batch; a real batch shares its context and session between events, so it shrinks further."
          div [code]
            div [code-head]
              button [copy] label="Copy as text"
                "Copy"
            div [code-line]
              "1"
              span [code-text]
                "typed"
                ","
                "positional"
                "85"
                "bytes"
            div [code-line]
              "2"
              span [code-text]
                "JSON"
                ","
                "named"
                "208"
                "bytes"
            div [code-line]
              "3"
              span [code-text]
            div [code-line]
              "4"
              span [code-text]
                "//"
                "values"
                "in"
                "field"
                "order"
                ":"
                "180"
                ","
                "true"
      div [station:store]
        div [station-dot]
        div [station-head]
          "Store"
          "events on sqlite"
        button [station-toggle] label="Store station"
          "▾"
        div [station-body]
          "Events land in"
          "events"
          "as they arrive; sessions and persons are kept up to date beside them as each batch is stored, so a query reads tables, never a queue. These are the ones this query read."
          div [code]
            div [code-head]
              button [copy] label="Copy as text"
                "Copy"
            div [code-line]
              "1"
              span [code-text]
                "events"
            div [code-line]
              "2"
              span [code-text]
                "uuid"
                "BLOB"
            div [code-line]
              "3"
              span [code-text]
                "name"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "4"
              span [code-text]
                "distinct_id"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "5"
              span [code-text]
                "person_id"
                "BLOB"
            div [code-line]
              "6"
              span [code-text]
                "timestamp"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "7"
              span [code-text]
                "received_at"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "8"
              span [code-text]
                "session_id"
                "BLOB"
            div [code-line]
              "9"
              span [code-text]
                "context_id"
                "INTEGER"
            div [code-line]
              "10"
              span [code-text]
                "properties"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "11"
              span [code-text]
                "source"
                "INTEGER"
      div [station:ask]
        div [station-dot]
        div [station-head]
          "Ask"
          "the query"
        button [station-toggle] label="Ask station"
          "▾"
        div [station-body]
          "Every insight is one value of the typed"
          "Query"
          "enum. The SQL is what it became. It ran 2 statements on sqlite in <n> ms. Change the builder and these lines change with it."
          div role=tablist label="Ask as"
            button [ask-tab:rust] role=tab
              "Rust"
            button [ask-tab:sql] role=tab
              "SQL"
            button [ask-tab:http] role=tab
              "HTTP"
          div [ask-panel:rust] role=tabpanel
            div [code]
              div [code-head]
                "Rust"
                button [copy] label="Copy as Rust"
                  "Copy"
              div [code-line]
                "1"
                span [code-text]
                  "use"
                  "leptoskit_analytics"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "query"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "*;"
              div [code-line]
                "2"
                span [code-text]
              div [code-line]
                "3"
                span [code-text]
                  "let"
                  "query"
                  "="
                  "Query"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "Trends(TrendsQuery"
                  "{"
              div [code-line]
                "4"
                span [code-text]
                  "range"
                  ":"
                  "DateRange"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "between("
                  "\"2026-10-05T00:00:00Z\""
                  ","
                  "\"2026-11-02T00:00:00Z\""
                  ")"
                  ","
              div [code-line]
                "5"
                span [code-text]
                  "interval"
                  ":"
                  "Interval"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "Week"
                  ","
              div [code-line]
                "6"
                span [code-text]
                  "series"
                  ":"
                  "vec!"
                  "["
              div [code-line]
                "7"
                span [code-text]
                  "\"note_created\""
                  ".into()"
                  ","
              div [code-line]
                "8"
                span [code-text]
                  "]"
                  ","
              div [code-line]
                "9"
                span [code-text]
                  "filters"
                  ":"
                  "Vec"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "new()"
                  ","
              div [code-line]
                "10"
                span [code-text]
                  "math"
                  ":"
                  "Math"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "Total"
                  ","
              div [code-line]
                "11"
                span [code-text]
                  "breakdown"
                  ":"
                  "None"
                  ","
              div [code-line]
                "12"
                span [code-text]
                  "compare"
                  ":"
                  "true"
                  ","
              div [code-line]
                "13"
                span [code-text]
                  "test_accounts"
                  ":"
                  "None"
                  ","
              div [code-line]
                "14"
                span [code-text]
                  "}"
                  ");"
              div [code-line]
                "15"
                span [code-text]
              div [code-line]
                "16"
                span [code-text]
                  "//"
                  "From"
                  "the"
                  "app's"
                  "server"
                  ","
                  "as"
                  "the"
                  "app"
                  ":"
              div [code-line]
                "17"
                span [code-text]
                  "let"
                  "answer"
                  "="
                  "rpc"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "client"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "call_as_app(Run"
                  "{"
                  "query"
                  "}"
                  ").await?;"
          div [ask-panel:sql] role=tabpanel
            div [code]
              div [code-head]
                "SQL"
                button [copy] label="Copy as SQL"
                  "Copy"
              div [code-line]
                "1"
                span [code-text]
                  "--"
                  "trends"
                  ":"
                  "note_created"
                  "(sqlite)"
              div [code-line]
                "2"
                span [code-text]
                  "SELECT"
                  "strftime('%Y-%m-%dT00"
                  ":"
                  "00"
                  ":"
                  "00'"
                  ","
                  "\"events\""
                  "."
                  "\"timestamp\""
                  ","
                  "?4"
                  ","
                  "'-6"
                  "days'"
                  ","
                  "'weekday"
